  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate football-themed sanctuary with the custom sports bedding set by Jeminise. Featuring a bold digital illustration of a red football player running with the ball against an American flag design with vibrant paint splatters, this bedding set is the perfect customizable addition to any sports fan's bedroom.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with two text inputs, allowing you to add your chosen Name and Number directly onto the design.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy Comforter &amp; Duvet Options:</strong> Available as either a lightweight duvet cover designed for an insert or an all-in-one cozy comforter with a warm microfiber filling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester microfiber fabric that is soft, breathable, lightweight, and durable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features compact edge stitching for durability and advanced dyeing techniques to prevent fading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry on low heat or air dry without heat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Red Football Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) + Optional Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
